/*
 * HooknLoop redesign — Suruchi's `footer` section replaced by `hnl-footer`,
 * the port of storefront/src/sections/Footer.jsx.
 *
 * Suruchi's own footer, its five link_list blocks and the email-popup are
 * preserved in git at the pristine backup commit; restore this file from there
 * to put the stock footer back.
 *
 * mobile-navigation-bar is KEPT. It is Suruchi's equivalent of the React
 * BottomNav — same five destinations, already wired to the live cart and
 * account routes — so replacing it would be a rewrite with no visible gain.
 *
 * email-popup is dropped: the redesign's footer already carries the signup,
 * and it was set to "disable" anyway, so nothing is lost.
 */
